# A query that starts with a pipe.
mode: syntax
---- query
| take 5
---- expected
PROGRAM@0..9
  PIPELINE@0..8
    PIPE@0..1 "|"
    WHITESPACE@1..2 " "
    TAKE_OP@2..8
      IDENT@2..6 "take"
      WHITESPACE@6..7 " "
      LITERAL@7..8
        LONG@7..8 "5"
  WHITESPACE@8..9 "\n"

error[DS0125]: a query starts with a table, not with `|`
  --> query:1:1
  |
1 | | take 5
  | ^ this pipe has nothing to read from
  |
  = help: start the query with `from` and a file path such as `from 'data.csv'`, or `from` and a table name
